&lt;li&gt;Increase contracts per active dealer and overall territory production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Focus on growing volume in Tier 3–5 segments while maintaining quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive penetration targets (e.g., 3+ and 5+ deals per dealer per month)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Credit &amp;amp; Deal Structuring&lt;/p&gt;
