&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary and stock option plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid coverage of medical, dental, and vision insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible PTO&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunities for professional growth and development within a rapidly expanding transformation team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid parental leave&lt;/li&gt;
