&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(58, 59, 65); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(58, 59, 65); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;We are seeking an experienced and strategic Director of Sales to join our Flex Pay BNPL retail team. This person will play a pivotal role in driving revenue growth, building strategic partnerships, and expanding our footprint in BNPL.&amp;nbsp; This senior level IC will prospect, nurture, and sign a robust pipeline of Enterprise and Mid- Market merchants to drive net new Flex Pay merchant acquisition. We are looking for a self-starter who can thrive in a fast-paced growth environment to take Flex Pay to the next level.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
