&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(58, 59, 65); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(58, 59, 65); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Leverage customer feedback, market insights, and industry trends to refine sales approaches and inform product development and adoption.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
