&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(58, 59, 65); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(58, 59, 65); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Upgrade is building out our sales team for our home improvement financing business. We&#39;re looking for an SDR to help build that pipeline from the ground up.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(58, 59, 65); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll focus on getting home improvement contractors and merchants interested in offering consumer financing through Upgrade. This is a ground-floor role with a clear path forward. SDRs who perform here move into Account Executive roles as the team grows. You&#39;ll help shape how we prospect, who we target, and how we build this business.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(58, 59, 65); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;If you want real ownership early in your sales career, backed by an established fintech, this is the role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(58, 59, 65); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(58, 59, 65); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Run outbound prospecting. You&#39;ll cold call, email, and sequence across multiple channels to book demos with home improvement contractors and merchants. Your goal is getting the right people in front of our AEs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(58, 59, 65); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Qualify your prospects. You&#39;ll ask the right questions to understand fit and share relevant product context before handing off to Sales.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(58, 59, 65); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Build target lists with the team. You&#39;ll work with Sales and Customer Success to research accounts, develop outreach strategies, and keep the pipeline moving.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(58, 59, 65); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Set the standard. You&#39;ll help establish the habits and norms that define this team&#39;s culture as we grow.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(58, 59, 65); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(58, 59, 65); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Comfort with outbound. You&#39;re not put off by cold calling. You understand that volume and consistency drive results.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(58, 59, 65); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;A desire to do more than hit a number. You want to contribute to how this team sells, not just execute a script.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(58, 59, 65); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Strong communication skills. You can build rapport quickly, ask good questions, and clearly explain why someone should take a meeting.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(58, 59, 65); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Adaptability. This is an early team. Things change. You adjust and keep moving.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(58, 59, 65); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;A collaborative approach. You&#39;ll work closely with AEs and Customer Success and need to share information and stay aligned across the team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(58, 59, 65); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Where This Role Goes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
