&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(58, 59, 65); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Health &amp;amp; wellness initiatives&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
