&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(58, 59, 65);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(58, 59, 65);&quot;&gt;5+ years of product management experience focused on delivering high-quality outcomes and user value&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(58, 59, 65);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(58, 59, 65);&quot;&gt;Expertise in product development ideally a combination of complex third party APIs, integration, web analytics, A/B testing, and SQL&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(58, 59, 65);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(58, 59, 65);&quot;&gt;A history of successful product delivery particularly in consumer-facing platforms and innovative fintech space. Experience in the travel industry is helpful but not required&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
