&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(58, 59, 65);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(58, 59, 65);&quot;&gt;Familiarity with AI coding and productivity tools such as Claude or Gemini. Experience using these tools to perform analysis, generate specifications, build prototypes, and conduct data analysis&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
